<title>USA: Hartford Life options to be traded on AMEX.</title>
<headline>Hartford Life options to be traded on AMEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Options on Hartford Life Inc will start trading Friday June 6, the American Stock Exchange said Monday.</p>
<p>Options on the Simsbury, Conn., life insurer will open with strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and will have position limits of 4,500 contracts. Initial expiration months will be June, July, September and December. Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will act as the specialist for the new options.</p>
</text>
